# Customer Churn Prediction & Lifetime Value

## Project Overview

This project predicts customer churn and estimates Customer Lifetime Value (LTV).

The project uses customer information such as:

- Customer tenure
- Monthly charges
- Customer prediction history

## Technologies Used

- Python
- Pandas
- Matplotlib
- Flask
- PostgreSQL
- SQL
- Bootstrap

